{'symbol': 'CVX', 'date': '2023-02-26 18:00:00', 'title': 'CHEVRON ANNOUNCES LOWER CARBON LNG FLEET MODIFICATION PROJECT WITH SEMBCORP MARINE', 'text': 'SAN RAMON, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--CHEVRON CORPORATION (NYSE: CVX), THROUGH ITS SUBSIDIARY CHEVRON SHIPPING COMPANY LLC, ANNOUNCED ENTRANCE INTO AN AGREEMENT WITH SEMBCORP MARINE REPAIRS & UPGRADES PTE. LTD, A WHOLLY OWNED SUBSIDIARY OF SEMBCORP MARINE LTD. (SEMBCORP MARINE), INTENDING TO REDUCE THE CARBON INTENSITY OF THEIR LNG FLEET OPERATIONS.'}